  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759254,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue (Game Boy Color) - Synopsis\n\nJoin Oddball and Domino, two adventurous Dalmatian puppies, in *102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue* for the Game Boy Color! When Cruella de Vil’s toy sales plummet, she hatches a dastardly plan to capture pets and freeze them into \"Super-Gloop\" toys. While their parents, Dipstick and Dottie, bravely embark on a rescue mission, Oddball and Domino must stay behind... or so they're told!\n\nIgnoring their parents' instructions, the resourceful pups set off on a quest to save their siblings and family from Cruella’s clutches. Explore vibrant, beautifully drawn levels inspired by iconic London landmarks like Regent’s Park and Big Ben. Navigate challenging platforming sections, solve puzzles, and collect stickers to fill your virtual sticker book, revealing a complete picture of the adventure.\n\nRescue puppies, avoid enemy toys, and uncover secrets within each level. With sharp, creative gameplay and a charming story, *102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue* delivers a delightful Game Boy Color experience for players of all ages."
    },
